umber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mASlexsbTZcep8WRTAEff5jqRqM.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2025-02-22\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Chang Ki-ha 'Anyway, it's Gamjatang'\",\"overview\":\"Kang-rok's dream restaurant is all about filling the blanks. But how does one fulfill an order for a pork back-bone stew that pairs well with wine?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3Le88KWxHEcffLVUxJwO12E8RcR.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2025-02-22\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Jung Hae-in 'Can one dish break down stereotypes?'\",\"overview\":\"The second order requests \\\"a dish that shatters conventions,\\\" turning Kang-rok into a contrarian. Will his unorthodox dish shatter all conventions?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7p7hSIVu4kcAJ9UROlJ31EN7Vr4.jpg\",\"rating\":8.7,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2025-02-22\",\"runtime\":37},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"GABEE 'Paris Hilton's midnight snack'\",\"overview\":\"What dish should we serve to a celebrity night owl? Late-night snacks and beer don’t sound right for someone on a diet. The reveal shocks Kang-rok.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2025-03-01\",\"runtime\":39},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Kang Leo 'The unforgettable tilefish dish'\",\"overview\":\"Bring out a tilefish dish that is out of the box and out of this world! Who's this zealous tilefish gourmet? Could it be who Kang-rok is thinking of?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-03-08\",\"runtime\":49},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"RISABAE 'Show me your spicy taste'\",\"overview\":\"Just spicy doesn't cut it. Kang-rok has all kinds of hot flavors in his arsenal to captivate our guest! Don't they say variety is the spice of life?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-03-15\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Young K 'Course meal reminiscent of bass'\",\"overview\":\"What doesn’t stand out but is a crucial part of any band? Bring on the bass guitar. Kang-rok composes a course meal that boasts a deep resonance.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-03-22\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"John Park, The Noodle to forget your first love\",\"overview\":\"Help me get over my first love! Today’s guest craves relationship advice. Kang-rok prepares a noodle dish cold enough to shock him into forgetfulness.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-03-29\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"SANA 'Gratin of a Summer Child Born in Winter'\",\"overview\":\"What gratin would a winter-born summer child enjoy? Will the guest go bananas for bananas? Kang-rok's banana gratin will put a smile on their face.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-05\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Chun Woo-hee 'Cold Buckwheat Noodles with Dad'\",\"overview\":\"Buckwheat noodles and pork cutlets are reminders of the good old days with her father. Kang-rok is about to revive childhood nostalgia for one guest.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-12\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"JISOO 'a bowl of warm soup in Alaska'\",\"overview\":\"An order for warm soup arrives from a faraway cabin in Alaska. Is our guest feeling okay? Kang-rok fixes a dish to relieve both hunger and loneliness.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-19\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Joo Hyun-young 'Unfamiliar Home Hood'\",\"overview\":\"I want to try something new! Today’s guest finds it hard to wean off her mother’s kimchi-jjigae. Kang-rok serves a braised dish to relieve her doubts.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-26\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Moon Sang-hoon 'Luxurious Mazesoba'\",\"overview\":\"Sang-hoon makes a surprise entrance as a guest to celebrate his final day! Kang-rok prepares a sumptuous mazesoba dish to send him off the right way.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-03\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Jang Do-yeon 'A dish that you won't regret eating even if you die'\",\"overview\":\"Today's guest wants a long and healthy life — and a dish that leaves her with no regrets. Hyun-young joins in as Kang-rok makes a case for longevity.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-10\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"KEY 'Fish Dishes on Special Days'\",\"overview\":\"I'd like a chef-inspired fish entree! Today's guest had fish on special days. Kang-rok's sea bream and seasonal veggies will make this a special day.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-17\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Yoo Seung-ho 'The food that is good as it is'\",\"overview\":\"Today's guest deserves a fierce meal after a life of hard work. This dish doesn't need to be perfect or complete. Life doesn't get better than curry.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-24\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Chung Seung-je 'Fine dining without the aftertaste'\",\"overview\":\"Why does fine dining makes one crave junky food? Today's guest is all about MSG. Kang-rok serves a dish bursting with the flavors of the sea and land.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-31\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Park Soi 'Chef Choi's Special School Meal'\",\"overview\":\"Today's guest looks a tad young and craves a school meal. Kang-rok whips up some Western cuisine that is served at a school cafeteria on special days.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-06-07\",\"runtime\":51},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Kang June Elizabeth 'Appetizer can be a meal, too'\",\"overview\":\"Today's guest is in a cheesy mood. Be it sweet, salty or nutty — variety is key! Kang-rok prepares five cheeses, an appetizer to rival the main dish.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-06-14\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"TABLO 'Elementary School, the Taste of Those Days'\",\"overview\":\"On the final day, a contemporary requests a dish that piques nostalgia. Kang-rok delivers a modern taste of the good old elementary school days.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-06-21\",\"runtime\":53}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2025-02-22\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}